Since you're learning Python, you have two reasonable paths.

Option A — JavaScript/React

Frontend
React + TypeScript
       ↓
Backend
Node.js + Express
       ↓
Google Gemini API
       ↓
Database
Firebase / Supabase

Option B — Python

Frontend
HTML + CSS + JavaScript
       ↓
Backend
Python + Flask/FastAPI
       ↓
Google Gemini API
       ↓
Database
SQLite / PostgreSQL

For your BCA portfolio, I would structure the project so you can clearly explain each layer rather than relying entirely on AI-generated code.


