⭐ A good unique feature

“Exam Mode”

This could make the project especially relevant to college students.

Student selects:

Subject: DBMS
Topic: Transactions
Marks: 5

EduGenie generates an answer appropriate for 5 marks, rather than giving a huge generic explanation.

You could support:

2 marks | 5 marks | 8 marks | 10 marks

And include:

> Key points to remember



That demonstrates that your app is doing more than simply forwarding questions to Gemini.


---

🔐 Important Gemini/API design

Don't put your Gemini API key directly inside frontend JavaScript.

Use:

Student
   ↓
React
   ↓
Your Backend
   ↓
Gemini API

The backend keeps the API credential away from the browser.


