🎓 BCA Project Objectives

You could define the project objectives as:

1. Develop an AI-powered educational assistant.


2. Integrate Google's Gemini AI into a web application.


3. Provide personalized explanations and study material.


4. Generate practice questions and quizzes.


5. Assist students with programming problems.


6. Support image-based educational questions.


7. Track student learning progress.


8. Provide a simple and mobile-friendly learning interface.



🏆 Project title

EduGenie: A Google Gemini Powered AI Learning Assistant for College Students

Short description

> EduGenie is an AI-powered learning assistant designed to help college students understand academic topics, generate study notes, practice questions, solve programming problems, and learn interactively using Google's Gemini AI.



This can become a much more complete BCA project than a basic chatbot if you build the learning workflow, progress tracking, and student-focused features around Gemini.
